{"parse": {"title": "不休荒原", "pageid": 3206, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"preamble\" style=\"--preamble-text-shadow: #FAE690\">\n    <div class=\"preamble-background\"></div>\n    <div class=\"preamble-content\"><p>门扉在箱子内的某处开启，从缝隙中吹来遥远而潮湿的风。</p><p>这之中有许多未解的事物，你尚不明晰门后的天地形状。</p><p>推开它，岛屿浮于海面，荒岛漫散生机。</p></div>\n</div>\n<p>不休荒原是重返未来：1999的家园机制。玩家可放置孤屿，并在上面放置建筑来自定义荒原；玩家可于此中收集角色养成资源，进行养成素材合成与提高角色的信任度。2.2版本为不休荒原内添加了新玩法【<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%91%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F/%E9%AD%94%E7%B2%BE%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8\" title=\"不休荒原/魔精公司\">“新巴别塔”魔精公司</a>】。\n</p>\n\n<h2><span id=\".E8.A3.85.E9.A5.B0.E8.8D.92.E5.8E.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"装饰荒原\">装饰荒原</span></h2>\n<p>在不休荒原内，可以摆放多样的孤屿和建筑，并可将已拥有的角色添加到荒原中，放置的角色会随机出现在荒原各处，并根据时间的推移提高信任度。编辑荒原时，可将左下角随机生成的孤屿放置到边缘不同位置以拓展荒原，不同稀有度的孤屿可获得不同的活力值。建筑必须放置在一块符合要求的空孤屿上，并可提供大量的活力值。\n</p><p>荒原内可以对荒原古厅、微尘钟楼、利齿市集、如愿甘泉四个核心建筑进行主题定制；游戏内还可以对水体孤屿进行风格定制。\n</p><p>可以在银行-荒原构想使用<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"2/23\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F%E9%BD%BF%E8%B4%9D\" title=\"荒原齿贝\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F%E9%BD%BF%E8%B4%9D\" title=\"荒原齿贝\"><img alt=\"荒原齿贝\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/CurrencyItem-190006.png/100px-CurrencyItem-190006.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/CurrencyItem-190006.png/150px-CurrencyItem-190006.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/CurrencyItem-190006.png/200px-CurrencyItem-190006.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F%E9%BD%BF%E8%B4%9D\" title=\"荒原齿贝\">荒原齿贝</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">遗落在荒原中的齿贝。可用于银行内[荒原构想]处的兑换。</span></span></span>或<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"2/2\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%AF%E9%9B%A8%E6%BB%B4\" title=\"纯雨滴\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%AF%E9%9B%A8%E6%BB%B4\" title=\"纯雨滴\"><img alt=\"纯雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/CurrencyItem-202.png/100px-CurrencyItem-202.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/CurrencyItem-202.png/150px-CurrencyItem-202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/CurrencyItem-202.png/200px-CurrencyItem-202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%AF%E9%9B%A8%E6%BB%B4\" title=\"纯雨滴\">纯雨滴</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">神秘学界昂贵无比的货币。可用于征集与恢复细胞活性。</span></span></span>购买或部分活动页面兑换来获得孤屿和建筑。孤屿和建筑一般有对应的风格套组，套组一般契合它对应版本的活动主题。\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".E8.8E.B7.E5.8F.96.E8.B5.84.E6.BA.90\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"获取资源\">获取资源</span></h2>\n<p>随现实时间流逝，<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>微尘钟楼</b></span>可产出<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"2/5\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BE%AE%E5%B0%98\" title=\"微尘\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BE%AE%E5%B0%98\" title=\"微尘\"><img alt=\"微尘\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/CurrencyItem-205.png/100px-CurrencyItem-205.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/CurrencyItem-205.png/150px-CurrencyItem-205.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/CurrencyItem-205.png/200px-CurrencyItem-205.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BE%AE%E5%B0%98\" title=\"微尘\">微尘</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">来自于至高音律的余振。可用于提升角色的等级。</span></span></span>；<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>利齿市集</b></span>可产出<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"2/3\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%A9%E9%BD%BF%E5%AD%90%E5%84%BF\" title=\"利齿子儿\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%A9%E9%BD%BF%E5%AD%90%E5%84%BF\" title=\"利齿子儿\"><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/CurrencyItem-203.png/100px-CurrencyItem-203.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/CurrencyItem-203.png/150px-CurrencyItem-203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/CurrencyItem-203.png/200px-CurrencyItem-203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%A9%E9%BD%BF%E5%AD%90%E5%84%BF\" title=\"利齿子儿\">利齿子儿</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">神秘学家的货币。各方各面都有所需。</span></span></span>；在<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>如愿甘泉</b></span>内可根据需要用低级<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%BB%E6%88%90%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99\" title=\"养成材料\">养成材料</a>合成高级养成材料。将角色放置在荒原中可为该角色提供信任度。有时会触发荒原内的角色的对话，获得<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"2/23\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F%E9%BD%BF%E8%B4%9D\" title=\"荒原齿贝\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F%E9%BD%BF%E8%B4%9D\" title=\"荒原齿贝\"><img alt=\"荒原齿贝\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/CurrencyItem-190006.png/100px-CurrencyItem-190006.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/CurrencyItem-190006.png/150px-CurrencyItem-190006.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/CurrencyItem-190006.png/200px-CurrencyItem-190006.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F%E9%BD%BF%E8%B4%9D\" title=\"荒原齿贝\">荒原齿贝</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">遗落在荒原中的齿贝。可用于银行内[荒原构想]处的兑换。</span></span></span>，对话内容可在本维基的对应角色页面查看到。\n</p><p>通过提升活力度达到一定梯度可以对资源收取提供不同加成，并允许额外邀请更多角色。\n</p>\n<dl><dd>通关<b>丰收时令</b>资源关卡，获得的<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/190007\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9F%AF%E6%81%A9%E5%AE%9D%E8%B4%9D\" title=\"柯恩宝贝\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9F%AF%E6%81%A9%E5%AE%9D%E8%B4%9D\" title=\"柯恩宝贝\"><img alt=\"柯恩宝贝\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Item-190007.png/100px-Item-190007.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Item-190007.png/150px-Item-190007.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Item-190007.png/200px-Item-190007.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9F%AF%E6%81%A9%E5%AE%9D%E8%B4%9D\" title=\"柯恩宝贝\">柯恩宝贝</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">象征丰收的收获祭司。能为荒原枢纽的各部分带来提升。</span></span></span>以及<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/190008\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9F%AF%E6%81%A9%E5%A4%AB%E4%BA%BA\" title=\"柯恩夫人\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9F%AF%E6%81%A9%E5%A4%AB%E4%BA%BA\" title=\"柯恩夫人\"><img alt=\"柯恩夫人\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/Item-190008.png/100px-Item-190008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/Item-190008.png/150px-Item-190008.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/Item-190008.png/200px-Item-190008.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9F%AF%E6%81%A9%E5%A4%AB%E4%BA%BA\" title=\"柯恩夫人\">柯恩夫人</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">象征丰收的收获主祭。能为荒原枢纽的各部分带来提升。</span></span></span>、完成主线获得的<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/190010\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%B0%E9%A5%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%90%E5%97%A3\" title=\"丰饶的子嗣\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%B0%E9%A5%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%90%E5%97%A3\" title=\"丰饶的子嗣\"><img alt=\"丰饶的子嗣\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/Item-190010.png/100px-Item-190010.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/Item-190010.png/150px-Item-190010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/Item-190010.png/200px-Item-190010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%B0%E9%A5%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%90%E5%97%A3\" title=\"丰饶的子嗣\">丰饶的子嗣</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">带来收获的地中之岩。能为荒原中的古厅带来提升。</span></span></span>可以用来升级核心建筑，来开启更多生产线，或升级古厅开启更多玩法。</dd></dl>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.9C.B0.E5.9D.97.E4.B8.80.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"地块一览\">地块一览</span></h2>\n<p><b><img alt=\"Main icon.svg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/16px-Main_icon.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/24px-Main_icon.svg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/32px-Main_icon.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><span style=\"user-select:none; padding-left:0\">&#160;</span>主条目：</b><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8\" title=\"荒原列表\">荒原列表</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".E9.AD.94.E7.B2.BE.E5.85.AC.E5.8F.B8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"魔精公司\">魔精公司</span></h2>\n<p><b><img alt=\"Main icon.svg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/16px-Main_icon.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/24px-Main_icon.svg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/32px-Main_icon.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><span style=\"user-select:none; padding-left:0\">&#160;</span>主条目：</b><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%91%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F/%E9%AD%94%E7%B2%BE%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8\" title=\"不休荒原/魔精公司\">不休荒原/魔精公司</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.9B.BE.E5.BA.93\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"图库\">图库</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 268.66666666667px\"><div style=\"width: 268.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 266.66666666667px;\"><div style=\"margin:0px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%91%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%91%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2.jpg/400px-%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%91%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"267\" height=\"120\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%91%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2.jpg/600px-%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%91%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%91%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2.jpg/800px-%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%91%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"2400\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>